flowchart TD
    U[User / iPhone Safari] --> UI[TemPad UI]
    UI --> SR[Speech Recognition]
    SR --> AJAX[HTTPS AJAX / fetch]
    UI --> AJAX
    AJAX --> API[Backend API]
    API --> AUTH[Auth + Validation]
    API --> AGENT[AI Agent]
    API --> DB[(MySQL)]
    API --> JOBS[Scheduler / Cron]
    AGENT --> DB
    AGENT --> OUT[JSON Response]
    OUT --> UI
    UI --> AUDIO[WAV/MP3 or Speech Synthesis]
